---
// MeetWhy (#4432): ported from the approved EnviousMeet mock-up.
---

<section class="s"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="s-head"><div><span class="eyebrow rule">Why people choose it</span><h2>We value privacy<br><em>and transparency.</em></h2></div>
  <p class="s-lede">Recording, transcription, speaker labels and local AI summaries all happen offline, on your Mac. Open source, and ready for your own AI key when you want the cloud.</p></div>
  <div class="orbit">
    <svg class="ring" viewBox="0 0 1000 400" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="ringGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#4f6bff"/><stop offset=".3" stop-color="#8a2be2"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#00d98b"/><stop offset=".8" stop-color="#ffb000"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#ff6a2b"/>
        </linearGradient>
        <filter id="ringGlow" x="-20%" y="-50%" width="140%" height="200%"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="9"/></filter>
      </defs>
      <ellipse cx="500" cy="200" rx="440" ry="150" fill="none" stroke="url(#ringGrad)" stroke-width="22" opacity=".55" filter="url(#ringGlow)"/>
      <ellipse cx="500" cy="200" rx="440" ry="150" fill="none" stroke="url(#ringGrad)" stroke-width="5"/>
      <ellipse class="streak" cx="500" cy="200" rx="440" ry="150" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round" pathLength="100" stroke-dasharray="6 94" opacity=".9"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="node o1"><span class="orb"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M2 8.8a15 15 0 0 1 20 0M5.5 12.4a10 10 0 0 1 13 0M9 16a5 5 0 0 1 6 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="19.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M3 3l18 18"/></svg></span><div class="ntext"><h3>Works offline</h3><p>Transcripts and AI summaries can run on your Mac with no internet.</p></div></div><div class="node o2"><span class="orb"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 7l-5 5 5 5M16 7l5 5-5 5M14 4l-4 16"/></svg></span><div class="ntext"><h3>Open source</h3><p>The code is public under GPLv3, so anyone can check how meetings are handled.</p></div></div><div class="node o3"><span class="orb"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20.6 13.4l-7.2 7.2a2 2 0 0 1-2.8 0L3 13V3h10l7.6 7.6a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.8z"/><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="1.6"/></svg></span><div class="ntext"><h3>Free, for real</h3><p>No account, no subscription, nothing locked. It comes with EnviousWispr.</p></div></div><div class="node o4"><span class="orb"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M7 10V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v3"/><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="3"/><path d="M9 14.5v2.5M12 13.5v4.5M15 14.5v2.5"/></svg></span><div class="ntext"><h3>Private by design</h3><p>Your audio never leaves your Mac. Envious Labs never sees your words.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
